  {
    "id": "c651420aeb",
    "title": "Inworld optimized Gemma 4 26B serving, with faster TTFT and lower input pricing",
    "url": "https://x.com/inworld/status/2123482738921447875",
    "publisher": "@inworld",
    "tier": "official",
    "published": "2026-11-19T18:25:12.000Z",
    "score": 4.6,
    "category_hint": "product",
    "text": "We’ve optimized Gemma 4 26B on Inworld to help consumer apps respond faster at lower cost.\n\n- 𝗨𝗽 𝘁𝗼 𝟴.𝟲× 𝗳𝗮𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿 𝘁𝗶𝗺𝗲 𝘁𝗼 𝗳𝗶𝗿𝘀𝘁 𝘁𝗼𝗸𝗲𝗻: 0.23s at p95 versus 1.97s for the median of 15 providers serving the same model on OpenRouter (Nov. 16).\n- 𝗡𝗲𝗮𝗿𝗹𝘆 𝟰𝟬% 𝗹𝗼𝘄𝗲𝗿 𝗶𝗻𝗽𝘂𝘁 𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗰𝗶𝗻𝗴: Compared with the median provider serving the same model, with additional savings on cached context.\n\nPricing per 1M tokens: $0.07 input · $0.34 output · $0.035 cached input.\n\nTry Gemma 4 26B and explore Inworld Inference at",
    "via": "https://x.com/inworld/status/2123482738921447875",
    "related": []
  },
